title: "JVM Heap OOM Field Guide"
message: "If you use this repository in your work, please cite it as follows."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Sonar"
    given-names: "Amit"
url: "https://github.com/amits710/jvm-oom-field-guide"
repository-code: "https://github.com/amits710/jvm-oom-field-guide"
abstract: >-
  Five reproducible Java heap OutOfMemoryError failure patterns for data
  pipelines and backend services. Each scenario pairs a broken reproduction
  with a diagnosis guide (GC-log signature, heap-dump clues, triage
  checklist) and a fixed version running the identical workload under
  identical JVM flags.
keywords:
  - java
  - jvm
  - outofmemoryerror
  - garbage-collection
  - heap-dump
  - memory-leak
  - data-engineering
